HOST-SUFFIX,doh.opendns.com,🚀 手选主流
HOST-SUFFIX,hk-hkg.doh.sb,🇭🇰 HK
IP-CIDR,8.8.8.8/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,8.8.4.4/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.1/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.1/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,185.222.222.222/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,208.67.222.222/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,208.67.220.220/32,🚀 手选主流,no-resolve

# 美国 T-Mobile / Ultra Mobile Wi-Fi Calling
